on prepareMovie
  [  0] pushint8 120 ............................ <120>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <120>
  [  5] extcall 47 .............................. <sprite(120)>
  [  8] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 11] setobjprop 57 ........................... sprite(120).visible = 1
  [ 14] ret
end
